    "Texture makeAliasable returns without forwarding when _buffer or _parentTexture is non-null.",
    "Texture isAliasable forwards to _buffer first, then _parentTexture; roots read inverse pinned state.",
    "Resource makeAliasable calls heap unpinMemoryAtOffset:withLength: only while heap exists and pinned is true, then clears pinned.",
